      <link>https://www.inside.com.tw/article/40800-tsmc-falls-nt120-in-biggest-single-day-drop-ever-as-market-value-slips-to-nt45-9-trillion</link>
      <description>受國際情勢與美股影響，台積電股價創歷史最大跌點，重挫 120 元至 1770 元，摜破月線。市值降至 45.9兆元，拖累大盤逾 960 點。其 ADR亦下跌逾 4%。</description>
